			"Message": "docs(Element): Add .README-TEMPLATE.md for consistent Element submodule docs\n\nIntroduce a canonical README template for all Land Element submodules to enforce uniform documentation structure across the codebase.\n\nThe template defines a consistent layout: name/tagline header, license badge, overview, architecture diagram slot, key components table, integration context within Land, build instructions, API reference links, and required NLnet/NGI0 funding attribution with logo grid. It uses `{Placeholder}` markers for Element-specific content.\n\nThis standardises the look and discoverability of Element READMEs, making it easier for contributors to navigate and maintain submodule documentation.",
